    "audioSha256": "16113f433b8374c2d6e0fa15f19fdbb9dc0f52edd34c87e95101ca73397a9633",
    "displayedText": "Burrow places his dirty boot by the door to reveal the next walk.",
    "displayedTextSha256": "f6b4343841528826fd5755f3cb573c6380319aabbd81d816e230e4d200e3264b",
